1
00:04:56,842 --> 00:05:02,842
Four friends. One trip. No luck.

2
00:09:53,684 --> 00:09:59,684
Joy Ride is a comedy film directed by Adele Lim.

3
00:14:50,526 --> 00:14:56,526
When Audrey's business trip to Asia goes sideways, she enlists the aid of Lolo, her irreverent, childhood best friend who also
happens to be a hot mess; Kat, her college friend turned Chinese soap star; and Deadeye, Lolo's eccentric cousin.

4
00:19:47,368 --> 00:19:53,368
Their no-holds-barred, epic experience becomes a journey of bonding, friendship, belonging, and wild
debauchery that reveals the universal truth of what it means to know and love who you are.

5
00:24:44,210 --> 00:24:50,210
Audrey, played by Ashley Park.

6
00:29:41,052 --> 00:29:47,052
Lolo, played by Sherry Cola.

7
00:34:37,894 --> 00:34:43,894
Kat, played by Stephanie Hsu.

8
00:39:34,736 --> 00:39:40,736
Deadeye, played by Sabrina Wu.

9
00:44:31,578 --> 00:44:37,578
Chao, played by Ronny Chieng.

10
00:49:28,421 --> 00:49:34,421
Nai Nai Chen, played by Lori Tan Chinn.

11
00:54:25,263 --> 00:54:31,263
Joy Ride is a 2023 American comedy film directed by Adele Lim, and
written by Cherry Chevapravatdumrong and Teresa Hsiao.

12
00:59:22,105 --> 00:59:28,105
The film stars Ashley Park, Sherry Cola, Stephanie Hsu, and Sabrina Wu.

13
01:04:18,947 --> 01:04:24,947
The film was announced in 2018 following a partnership deal between Point Grey
Pictures and Lionsgate, with Lim being confirmed as director in 2021.

14
01:09:15,789 --> 01:09:21,789
The cast was announced between August and October of the same year, and
filming took place in British Columbia throughout the latter month.

15
01:14:12,631 --> 01:14:18,631
Joy Ride had its world premiere at SXSW on March 17, 2023, and was released
in the United States on July 7, 2023, by Lionsgate Films.

16
01:19:09,473 --> 01:19:15,473
It received positive reviews from critics and grossed $16 million.

17
01:24:06,315 --> 01:24:12,315
The film explores themes of female friendship, adopted
child, woman director, asian american.

18
01:29:03,157 --> 01:29:09,157
The tone is lighthearted.
